                                    <br /><br />
                                    <span style="color:#e8f4f8; font-weight:600;">Adjusting the size:</span> Use the <span style="color:#00e5c0; font-weight:700;">SCREEN ZOOM</span> button in the top toolbar and drag the amber <span style="color:#f59e0b; font-weight:700;">RISK AND LEARNING</span> slider.
