                                "The button shows a megaphone icon. A dialog opens showing the full briefing content for the current shift and date. " +
                                "You can scroll through the briefing to read all notes and announcements.",
                                "#22c55e"); }

                            @{ InfoBox(Icons.Material.Filled.CheckCircle, "THE GREEN BADGE -- WHAT IT MEANS",
                                "Before you open the briefing, the toolbar button has no badge (or a neutral indicator). " +
                                "Once you open and view the briefing dialog, the button badge turns green. " +
                                "The green badge is a visual confirmation to supervisors and colleagues on the same screen that the briefing has been checked for this session. " +
                                "The badge resets each time you launch or relaunch the dashboard, so it must be acknowledged each shift.",
