                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div style="background:#22c55e0a; border:1px solid #22c55e22; border-radius:10px; padding:12px 14px; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:8px;">
                                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Lightbulb" Style="color:#22c55e; font-size:15px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px;" />
                                <div style="color:#7ab3cc; font-size:11px; line-height:1.7;">
                                    The green badge is a session indicator only -- it does not write anything to the database or submit a formal acknowledgement record.
                                    It is a quick visual cue for the shift team to confirm the briefing has been seen on this screen during the current session.
